<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <!-- Each page's own title, description and address. The build replaces
         everything between the page-head markers in each page it writes
         (scripts/prerender.mjs), and nginx replaces it with the API's for
         articles, issues and archives (nginx.conf). What is here is the
         homepage's, and the fallback for every other address. -->
    <title>IJMST: International Journal of Modern Science and Technology</title>
    <meta name="description" content="International Journal of Modern Science and Technology is a quarterly, peer-reviewed open-access journal across the sciences, engineering, technology and management. ISSN 2456-0235." />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://ijmstpublications.com/" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://ijmstpublications.com/" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="IJMST: International Journal of Modern Science and Technology" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="International Journal of Modern Science and Technology is a quarterly, peer-reviewed open-access journal across the sciences, engineering, technology and management. ISSN 2456-0235." />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="IJMST: International Journal of Modern Science and Technology" />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="International Journal of Modern Science and Technology is a quarterly, peer-reviewed open-access journal across the sciences, engineering, technology and management. ISSN 2456-0235." />

    <!-- PNG, not the SVG: the seal is now the photographed medallion, and a
         browser given an SVG icon prefers it over every PNG offered. The
         apple-touch-icon is what Safari uses for a home-screen bookmark, which
         falls back to a blurry page screenshot when it is missing. -->
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32.png" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />

    <!-- The journal moved from ijmst.co to ijmstpublications.com. Each page's
         canonical address (above) names the new home, so the two domains are
         not indexed as rivals. -->
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="International Journal of Modern Science and Technology" />
    <!-- 1200x630 PNG, not the SVG: no social scraper renders SVG, and
         logo-medallion.svg is a parked mark that was never wired into the UI. -->
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://ijmstpublications.com/og-cover.png" />
    <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
    <meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content="International Journal of Modern Science and Technology, ISSN 2456-0235" />
    <!-- large_image, not summary: summary crops to a small square and throws
         away the wordmark the card exists to show. -->
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://ijmstpublications.com/og-cover.png" />

    <!-- Type system: base (Spectral / Public Sans / IBM Plex Mono) + font-preset families -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Spectral:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500;1,600&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Newsreader:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Source+Serif+4:wght@400;500;600&family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;1,9..144,400&family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <script type="module" crossorigin src="/assets/index-oXv1ZAJf.js"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" crossorigin href="/assets/index-BmBdWme-.css">
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="root"><div class="news-ticker" aria-label="Latest news and announcements"><div class="wrap nt-wrap"><div class="nt-label"><span class="nt-dot"></span> News</div><div class="nt-viewport"><div class="nt-track"><a class="nt-item" href="/authors?sec=submit"><span class="nt-sep">◆</span> <!-- -->Call for Papers: submissions open for the upcoming issue</a><a class="nt-item" href="/contact"><span class="nt-sep">◆</span> <!-- -->Now inviting reviewers &amp; editorial board members to apply</a><a class="nt-item" href="/archives"><span class="nt-sep">◆</span> <!-- -->All articles are open access: free to read, download and cite</a><a class="nt-item" href="/authors?sec=submit"><span class="nt-sep">◆</span> <!-- -->Call for Papers: submissions open for the upcoming issue</a><a class="nt-item" href="/contact"><span class="nt-sep">◆</span> <!-- -->Now inviting reviewers &amp; editorial board members to apply</a><a class="nt-item" href="/archives"><span class="nt-sep">◆</span> <!-- -->All articles are open access: free to read, download and cite</a></div></div></div></div><header><div class="masthead"><div class="wrap"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark"><img src="/logo.png" alt="IJMST"/></span><div class="brand-text"><div class="b-name"><span class="b-name-full">International Journal of Modern Science and Technology</span><span class="b-name-short">IJMST</span></div><div class="b-sub">ISSN 2456-0235</div></div></a><div class="masthead-actions"><a href="/authors?sec=submit" class="btn btn-primary">Submit Manuscript <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div><button class="mobile-search" aria-label="Search articles"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg></button><button class="nav-menu-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-nav" aria-label="Open menu"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 18h16"></path></svg> Menu</button></div><div id="mobile-nav" class="mobile-nav" hidden=""><a href="/" class="active">Home</a><a href="/about" class="">About</a><a href="/board" class="">Editorial Board</a><a href="/authors" class="">Guide for Authors</a><a href="/current" class="">Current Issue</a><a href="/archives" class="">Archives</a><a href="/indexing" class="">Indexing</a><a href="/ethics" class="">Publication Ethics</a><a href="/contact" class="">Contact</a><div class="mobile-nav-actions"><a href="/authors?sec=submit" class="btn btn-primary">Submit Manuscript <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><nav class="nav"><div class="wrap"><a class="nav-mini-brand" href="/"><img class="nmb-mark" src="/logo.png" alt=""/> IJMST</a><div class="nav-links"><a href="/" class="active">Home</a><a href="/about" class="">About</a><a href="/board" class="">Editorial Board</a><a href="/authors" class="">Guide for Authors</a><a href="/current" class="">Current Issue</a><a href="/archives" class="">Archives</a><a href="/indexing" class="">Indexing</a><a href="/ethics" class="">Publication Ethics</a><a href="/contact" class="">Contact</a></div><button class="nav-search-btn"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg> Search articles</button></div></nav></header><div id="scroll-progress" aria-hidden="true"></div><main><section class="hero hero--animated" id="home"><div class="hero-backdrop" aria-hidden="true"><div class="hb-par" data-depth="4"><span class="hb-blob hb-blob1"></span></div><div class="hb-par" data-depth="8"><span class="hb-blob hb-blob2"></span></div><div class="hb-par" data-depth="13"><span class="hb-ring hb-ring1"></span></div><div class="hb-par" data-depth="19"><span class="hb-ring hb-ring2"></span></div><div class="hb-par" data-depth="26"><span class="hb-dot hb-dot1"></span><span class="hb-dot hb-dot2"></span><span class="hb-dot hb-dot3"></span><span class="hb-dot hb-dot4"></span></div></div><div class="wrap"><div class="hero-grid"><div class="hero-left reveal"><div class="hero-kicker"><span class="tag">Multidisciplinary · Open Access</span><a class="xref" href="https://www.crossref.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/crossref-doi.svg" alt="Crossref DOI" width="132" height="32"/></a><span class="peer">INDEPENDENT PEER REVIEW</span></div><h1>Advancing science, engineering and technology, openly.</h1><p class="hero-lede">A quarterly, peer-reviewed open-access journal publishing original research, reviews and short communications across the sciences, engineering, technology and management.</p><div class="search-shell"><button type="button" class="search-trigger" aria-label="Search articles, authors, keywords"><span class="search-input-wrap"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg><span class="search-trigger-ph">Search articles, authors, keywords…</span></span><span class="btn btn-primary btn-lg search-trigger-cta" aria-hidden="true">Search</span></button></div></div><div class="hero-right reveal"><div class="cover-card"><div class="cover-top"><div class="ci-label">Current Issue</div><div class="ci-date">Latest articles online</div><div class="cover-issn"><span>ISSN 2456-0235</span><span>OPEN ACCESS</span></div></div><div class="cover-list"><div class="clh">In this issue</div><a class="cover-item" href="/current"><span class="ctitle">Read the current issue</span></a></div><div class="cover-foot"><a href="/current">View full table of contents <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="stats-band reveal" aria-label="Journal at a glance"><div class="sb-backdrop" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sb-orb"></span><span class="sb-dot sb-dot1"></span><span class="sb-dot sb-dot2"></span><span class="sb-dot sb-dot3"></span></div><div class="wrap stats-band-wrap"><div class="stats-band-grid"><div class="sb-stat"><div class="n">Quarterly</div><div class="l">Peer-reviewed</div></div><div class="sb-stat"><div class="n"><span data-count="100">100</span><span class="unit">%</span></div><div class="l">Open access</div></div></div></div></section><section class="browse section" id="browse"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">Explore the journal</div><h2 style="margin-top:12px">Browse by subject area</h2><p class="sh-sub">Disciplines spanning the sciences, engineering, technology and management. Select a field to see its articles.</p></div><a class="section-link" href="/archives">View all archives <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div><div class="disc-grid reveal"><div class="no-results"><a class="nr-big" href="/archives">Browse the archive</a></div></div></div></section><section class="section" id="articles"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">Latest research</div><h2 style="margin-top:12px">Latest articles</h2><p class="sh-sub">The most recently published, peer-reviewed and freely available research.</p></div><a class="section-link" href="/archives">Browse all archives <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div><div class="article-list as-list"><div class="no-results"><a class="nr-big" href="/current">Read the current issue</a></div></div></div></section><section class="join-sec" id="editorial-board"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:34px"><div><div class="eyebrow">Get involved</div><h2 style="margin-top:12px">Be part of IJMST</h2><p class="sh-sub">Publish your research, shape the journal, or explore eleven years of open-access scholarship.</p></div></div><div class="join-cards three"><div class="join-card dark reveal"><div class="jc-deco"></div><div class="jc-eyebrow"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 18V6"></path><path d="m7 10 5-5 5 5"></path><path d="M5 20h14"></path></svg>For authors</div><h3>Publish your research</h3><p>Submit research articles, reviews or short communications. Fast, fair peer review by independent experts and permanent open access.</p><a href="/authors?sec=submit" class="btn btn-on-dark">Submit a manuscript <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div><div class="join-card light reveal"><div class="jc-eyebrow"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5"></circle><path d="M3 20c0-3.3 2.7-6 6-6s6 2.7 6 6"></path><path d="M16 5a3 3 0 0 1 0 6M21 20c0-2.5-1.3-4.6-3.3-5.5"></path></svg>Editorial board</div><h3>Join the board</h3><p>We welcome qualified academicians and researchers as editors and reviewers across all subject areas.</p><a href="/contact" class="btn btn-ghost">Apply to join <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div><div class="join-card light reveal"><div class="jc-eyebrow"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"></path><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"></path></svg>Archive</div><h3>Explore 11 volumes</h3><p>Browse the full archive of peer-reviewed research from 2016 to today. Every article is free to read and cite.</p><a href="/archives" class="btn btn-ghost">Browse archives <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section></main><footer class="footer" id="contact"><div class="wrap"><div class="foot-grid"><div class="foot-brand"><a class="fb-mark" href="/"><img class="m" src="/logo.png" alt=""/><div class="fb-name">IJMST</div></a><div class="foot-issn">ISSN 2456-0235</div><p>International Journal of Modern Science and Technology is a quarterly, peer-reviewed open-access journal promoting science, engineering, technology and management.</p></div><div class="foot-col"><h4>Journal</h4><a href="/about">About IJMST</a><a href="/board">Editorial Board</a><a href="/about?sec=oa">Open Access Policy</a><a href="/indexing">Indexing</a><a href="/ethics">Publication Ethics</a></div><div class="foot-col"><h4>Authors</h4><a href="/authors">Guide for Authors</a><a href="/authors?sec=submit">Submit Manuscript</a><a href="/authors?sec=apc">Article Processing</a><a href="/authors?sec=downloads">Author Resources</a><a href="/about?sec=oa">Copyright</a></div><div class="foot-col"><h4>Browse</h4><a href="/current">Current Issue</a><a href="/archives">Archives</a><a href="/?sec=browse">By Subject</a><a href="/current">Most Read</a><a href="/current">Latest Articles</a></div></div><div class="foot-bottom"><span>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <span class="fb-name-full">International Journal of Modern Science and Technology</span><span class="fb-name-short">IJMST</span>. All rights reserved.<span class="fb-credit">Designed and developed by<!-- --> <a href="https://www.logostech.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Logos Tech Solutions</a></span></span><div class="fb-links"><a href="/ethics">Ethics</a><a href="/about?sec=oa">Open Access</a><a href="/contact">Contact</a><button type="button" class="fb-link-btn">Cookie choices</button></div></div></div></footer></div>
  </body>
</html>
